hat floor, and it is a property of the REFERENCE, not of the component, which reproduces the routine bitwise. Step 1761 of case A, snow falling onto initially bare frozen ground: frozen precipitation (SNOWNG); air at -5.69 C, so the fresh snow falls at density 0.09827 against a pack already at 0.08971, and the fresh layer carries 3.990e-03 of the density average.",
