hat floor, and it is a property of the REFERENCE, not of the component, which reproduces the routine bitwise. Step 2089 of case A, snow falling onto initially bare frozen ground: FREEZING RAIN onto a sub-freezing surface (FRZGRA) -- the same routine, reached by SFLX's other guard; air at -4.18 C, so the fresh snow falls at density 0.11051 against a pack already at 0.11037, and the fresh layer carries 7.386e-03 of the density average.",
       "parameter_overrides": {
         "sfctmp": 268.9700927734375,
