hat floor, and it is a property of the REFERENCE, not of the component, which reproduces the routine bitwise. Step 169 of case C, a thin pack over soil that thaws and refreezes: frozen precipitation (SNOWNG); air at -7.77 C, so the fresh snow falls at density 0.08306 against a pack already at 0.17992, and the fresh layer carries 2.059e-03 of the density average.",
